      >, cropped, <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode" rel="license">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>
    </p>

    <p>
      <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:Basile_Morin">Basile Morin</a>, <a
